file tools/am/amphora_restore_negative_witness.rish the pen is opened by mktemp -d and interpolated at thirteen sites; the run sweeps its own pen at the close
file tools/fixtures/s/shared_pen_scan.sh reads all four pen spellings; the token lookahead is what keeps it from counting a repaired pen
file tools/fixtures/s/shared_pen_control.sh 24 behaviors on real git repositories, both ceilings from both sides, six free rules each planted and read as zero, the quoting rule shown in both directions
